      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: all american piece of shit; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image features a close-up of a man with the text 'all american' at the top and 'piece of shit' at the bottom. This juxtaposition is intended to insult and demean the individual depicted, using a derogatory label to attack his character and perceived moral worth. The meme is clearly abusive as it directly targets the person with vulgar language, aiming to degrade and insult him personally. There is no indication of targeting a protected group based on race, gender, religion, etc., but the intent is to demean the individual through crude and offensive language, which falls under abusive intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b800e2bd"
