      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as an 'all american' piece of shit",
      "description": "The textual phrase 'all american' at the top of the image is mapped onto the visual entity 'man', implying that the man is being labeled as 'all american'. This is an analogical mapping where the text assigns a derogatory label to the visual subject. The phrase 'piece of shit' at the bottom further reinforces this mapping by directly insulting the man, creating a complete negative characterization. The mapping is established through spatial adjacency and contextual juxtaposition, where the text explicitly identifies or labels the visual entity.",
